  "fact-check: the minimum entropy production theorem is Prigogine 1945 alone; Glansdorff and Prigogine 1971 extended the analysis",
  "fact-check: the mutual-information second law is Sagawa and Ueda 2008; their 2010 paper is the generalized Jarzynski equality",
